WHAT YOU MAY DO

Download this module, install it in Foundry VTT, and use it to run games at your
own table. That covers a game you stream, record or publish a video of.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO

Redistribute this module or any part of it. Host it for download. Bundle it with
anything else. Sell it, or charge for access to it. Publish a modified copy.

Extract the artwork for use outside this module.

